h96-media (8.0.0~r28) resolute; urgency=medium

  * MPRIS plugin for mpv: KDE media keys and CEC Play/Pause/Stop/seek
    control mpv (KDE media controller grabs media keys and forwards over
    MPRIS; mpv had no MPRIS name). mpv-mpris 1.2 (MIT) built without
    libavformat (embedded cover art dropped; folder and cover-art-files
    art kept), so no ffmpeg library packages:
    /usr/lib/h96/mpv-mpris/mpris.so, loaded from
    /etc/mpv/scripts/h96-mpris.so link; needs only glib (base image).
    Archive mpv-mpris package not used (its libavformat62 closure is 75
    packages, 118 MB).
  * cec-keymap.conf (conffile): back and return send KEY_ESC (was
    KEY_BACK), so TV remote Back acts as Escape in Steam Big Picture and
    dialogs; media transport comment names KDE to MPRIS path. Edited copy
    kept on upgrade (dpkg conffile prompt or confold).

